## 📄 File 3 — `.gitignore`

Save at the root of your project (`AnimeVault/.gitignore`):

```gitignore
# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*
*.swp

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
error_log

# Local config overrides (never commit real credentials)
backend/config/database.local.php

# Dependencies
node_modules/
vendor/

# Temp files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.sql.gz